 * HOME HERO | 70 × 70 content composition (desktop).
 * The content occupies 70% of both slide dimensions, vertically centered and left-aligned.
 * Individual kicker/title/subtitle/CTA elements share the available height.
 * Tablet/mobile remain content-first so text never clips behind slide dots.
 */
